get.description:
Win rate, average return and P&L per quote currency of closed trades, grouped by
strategy, symbol, or the emotions and tags recorded in the journal entries about them;
best average return first.

OpeningRange.description:
The high or low of the trading day's opening range: its bars that start in the
session's first `minutes`. Unknown until the last of them closes, and outside the session;
then the same for the rest of the day.
